# ====================================================================
# MINECRAFT WEBSITE ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION
# ====================================================================

# --------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. LEADERBOARD DATABASE (MySQL Server-Only)
# Direct connection to your Minecraft server's ajLeaderboards MySQL DB.
# NEVER prefix these with VITE_ or NEXT_PUBLIC_.
